  "title": { "zh": "四路电量改写", "en": "Four-Channel Power Rewrite" },
  "concept": { "zh": "四格内存 · 原地生成两份合计和两份差值", "en": "Four memory cells · Two totals and two differences in place" },
  "brief": {
    "zh": "地址 0、1、2、3 起初分别存着电池 A、B、C、D 的电量。维修终端只剩这四格内存，必须在原来的位置交出报告。停机时，地址 0 要存 A + B，地址 1 存 B − D，地址 2 存 C + D，地址 3 存 A − C，ACC 存四块电池的电量总和。公式中的字母都指改写前的电量。同一段指令要通过全部五组记录。",
    "en": "Addresses 0, 1, 2, and 3 start with the readings from batteries A, B, C, and D. These four cells are all the terminal has for its report. At HALT, address 0 must contain A + B, address 1 B − D, address 2 C + D, and address 3 A − C. Leave the total charge of all four batteries in ACC. Each letter refers to its original reading. Use the same program for all five cases."
  },
